how to use: 
install python 3.8 or more
use chromium-based browser or whatever 

install dependecies:
pip install -r requirements.txt

make sure the video.mp4 is in the same folder, if it is, run:
python video.py

after that run:
python vector.py

after that start the local server:
python server.py
(make sure port 8000 is open, or change it)

after server start open any osu userpage 
press F12 and paste the main.js script into the console

to stop, reload or close the page, or run this in console
window.stopBadApple();z

done, now you can larp touhou in osu 
